      "options": {
        "content": "## Network Assistant\n\nAsk questions about CPU, memory, interface throughput, and recent traps across R1/R2.\n\n**Examples:**\n- what is the CPU usage of R1?\n- how many times has R1 spiked in the past 6 hours?\n- what router has the highest load?\n- has there been any link flapping recently?\n\n**Known limits:** traps can't currently be attributed to a specific device (see docs/chatbot-plan.md); answers take a few seconds (no streaming).",
